# Medic station: a powered CONSUMER ("Medic energy/s" from its own energy buffer, cable-fed) that,
# while powered, heals the own player and own-team units inside "Medic heal radius" at "Medic
# heal/s" (GameMatch::tickMedicHealing). A 4x2x4 m block (2x2 cells), pale green with a taller
# white core. Spawned origin 1.0 above the ground hit.
Prefab gameMedicStation
